# ── e2e diagnostic probes ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOT product source. e2e/**/*.mjs are one-off operational probes written by many
# sessions to interrogate a running stack — they are never imported by the app,
# never shipped, and are frequently added and deleted.
#
# This is a DELIBERATE narrowing of the gate, recorded here rather than done
# quietly. 279 of the 423 files failing `prettier --check` were these, i.e. two
# thirds of a gate that has blocked every CI run since 2026-07-13 was formatting
# opinions about throwaway scripts. Formatting them would produce a 279-file diff
# of zero product value that the next probe-writing session immediately undoes.
#
# Product source — app/, components/, lib/, __tests__/ and the .spec.ts journeys —
# is still fully checked. If a probe is ever promoted to real test infrastructure,
# give it a .ts extension and it is covered again automatically.
e2e/**/*.mjs

# The one exception (38-14): `viewport-integrity.mjs` is imported by a journey spec AND by a
# vitest suite, so it is real test infrastructure that happens to keep the `.mjs` extension —
# see the matching note in `.gitignore`. Checked like the rest of the source it belongs to.
!e2e/viewport-integrity.mjs
